<%#
  Who posted a chat message or comment, and how: "Sem via Claude" when an
  access token posted it as its owner, "Claude for Sem" when it posted as an
  agent (see PostedVia). Goes where the author's name would.

  Required:
    record: a Chats::Message, Boards::Comment or Todos::Comment
%>
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary"><%= poster_name(record) %></span>
<% if record.agent? %>
  <span class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">for <%= record.user&.first_name || "a former member" %></span>
<% elsif record.via %>
  <span class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">via <%= record.via %></span>
<% end %>
